>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. REPORT.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY COMMON.
01 WS-COUNTER PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-ITEM-AMT PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
01 WS-STATUS PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-ITERATION PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LOGIC.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-COUNTER.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL.
    MOVE 1 TO WS-ITERATION.
    ADD 1 TO WS-COUNTER.
    COMPUTE WS-ITEM-AMT = WS-ITERATION * 100.
    ADD WS-ITEM-AMT TO WS-TOTAL.
    IF WS-ITEM-AMT > 300 THEN
        MOVE "OK" TO WS-STATUS
    ELSE
        MOVE "LO" TO WS-STATUS
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY "REPORT: ITEM=" WS-ITERATION " AMT=" WS-ITEM-AMT " STATUS=" WS-STATUS.
    DISPLAY "REPORT: COUNT=" WS-COUNTER.
    DISPLAY "REPORT: TOTAL=" WS-TOTAL.
    CALL "UTIL".
    EXIT PROGRAM.
